OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GMonday:FCold start with frost and      
OL,8,Fpatchy fog in places. Largely dry for  
OL,9,Fmany but rain returns to western areas 
OL,10,Flater. Breezy in the west, feeling     
OL,11,Fcold for most places.                  
OL,13,GOutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWet   
OL,14,Fand windy at times. Heavy rain and     
OL,15,Fhill snow affect northern and western  
OL,16,Fareas. Cold conditions persist, with   
OL,17,Ffrost and fog possible, before rain    
OL,18,Freaches Northern Ireland later         
OL,19,FThursday.                              
